  "details": "Find a Group has been replaced by Explore Groups earlier this year, but the Help & Info article still uses pictures of Find a Group.\n\n1. Open Main Menu.\n\n2. Click the \"?\" icon top right for Help & Info.\n\n3. Navigate to Safety group on the left.\n\n4. Click \"Report a Group\" and scroll down to find outdated photos.\n\n5. Compare to the current design of the Groups tab in Main Menu; you won't find \"Find a Group\" here, but \"Explore Groups\" with a different UI design instead.",
